    Damage Step, when your "Diabellstar" monster battles an opponent''s monster:
    You can banish this card from your GY; that opponent''s monster''s ATK becomes
    halved until the end of this turn. You can only use each effect of "Guilt of
    the Sinful Spoils" once per turn.'
